; Route the @dobeu-tech-eco scope to GitHub Packages for both publish and install.
; Auth is intentionally NOT stored here — keep the token in your user-level
; ~/.npmrc (see docs) so no credential is ever committed:
;   //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=<GitHub PAT with write:packages>
@dobeu-tech-eco:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
